%% Figure 2 — User Authentication and Role Resolution
flowchart LR
  Browser([User browser\nSAP Fiori UI]) --> Router[SAP BTP AppRouter]
  Router --> Session{Valid XSUAA\nsession?}
  Session -- No --> SignIn[XSUAA sign-in]
  SignIn --> Router

  Session -- Yes --> Request[Forward authenticated\nOData V4 request]
  Request --> CAP[CAP authentication layer\nResolve authenticated identity]
  CAP --> UserStore[(Internal Users\nand role mapping)]
  UserStore --> Active{Active internal user\nand exactly one\nbusiness role?}

  Active -- No --> Denied[403 denied\nNo business mutation]
  Active -- Yes --> Target{Requested\nUser Administration route?}

  Target -- No --> Protected[Process protected\nBug Management request]
  Target -- Yes --> Admin{PM business role\nand UserAdmin capability?}
  Admin -- No --> AdminDenied[403 denied\nAdministration unavailable]
  Admin -- Yes --> UserAdmin[Process protected\nUser Administration request]

  classDef entry fill:#eef5ff,stroke:#2b88d9,color:#172b4d;
